
>> shop := (Ordbok ny
	sett: ['magazine'] ved: ['books'],
	sett: ['computer'] ved: ['electronics'],
	sett: ['lipstick'] ved: ['cosmetics']
).
Utdata skriv: (shop har: ['computer']), stop. 
Utdata skriv: (shop har: ['sausage']), stop. 
Utdata skriv: (shop har: ['computers']), stop. 
